    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0340" n="322" sameAs="frus:frus1947v03/pg322"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.50 Recovery/7–1047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Griffis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Warsaw</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-10T16:00:00+02:00">July 10, 1947—4 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1092. Continuing my 1089 July 10.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d195-f1"/> In reference to
                    sudden change in Polish plans to send delegation Paris conference it is my
                    distinct and firm impression that Foreign Minister was honest in statement on
                    Monday that delegation would attend and again my firm impression last night that
                    he himself if not entire Polish Cabinet had in the interim been overruled by
                    higher authority. His attitude extremely apologetic and at least apparently
                    regretful.</p>
                <p>If Department has any desire receive Polish plan for reconstruction referred to
                    1089 please advise.</p>
                <p>Sent Dept; repeated Paris 155, London 112.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Griffis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
